*1 [[Ribbo]] spawns after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Star Peng]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Professor A.]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
