*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 180 seconds<sup>5,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
With the infinite Star Pengs coming out, you are expected to have ALL [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]] by this point; without them, don't bother, as missing even a single crystal will make the already tanky and powerful Star Pengs twice as strong. It's still possible to beat by spamming crowd-controllers to hell and back in order to permafreeze Star Peng, but requires very good luck to not get overwhelmed. In any case, it's usually better just to collect the treasures before attempting this stage.

Consider using [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] to deal with the Star Pengs and Dark enemies respectively, and [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] paired with [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Island Cat]] to help deal with the Professor A. The Ribbos' [[Barrier]]s may also pose a problem, so make sure to bring a [[:Category:Barrier Breaker Cats|Barrier Breaker]] or a unit that can shatter its barrier through damage like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], who can also deal with Professor A.

If for some ungodly reason you own [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] already, you can use the initial Ribbo as a stepping stone for Slime to wreak havoc on the entire battlefield. Once everything (aside from the Ribbo) is dead, simply break Ribbo's Barrier and claim your free Rare Tickets. Do note that Barrier Breakers or units with high damage, such as the aforementioned Awakened Bahamut Cat, will destroy Ribbo's Barrier prematurely and cause this strategy to fail.

==Hints==
These hints only appear as defeat messages given after losing the stage.
*Some units can nullify an enemy's<br>Warp ability. Check out the Equip menu<br>and filter for those Warp Blocker units<br>to add them to your Cat Army.
*Starred Aliens are a tough fight without<br>Treasures collected from Cats of the Cosmos.<br>Seek out those last few Treasures!

